{
  "contract": "praxis.provenance/1",
  "contractRevision": "1.2",
  "description": "keyFromEnvelopeV1 (contract 1.2): the v1 run id (when known) or the operation id is escaped per Unicode code point; everything except ASCII letters, digits and '-' becomes _xx per UTF-8 byte (lowercase hex), so '.', '_' and non-ASCII are always escaped and the mapping is injective. Namespaced keys (EXT-run.<namespace>.<id>, echelon-registry REG-PROV-008) escape both segments the same way. An id that is empty or not well-formed Unicode cannot form a key: 'error': true means the envelope must be rejected. 'envelopeText' is JSON text for inputs JSON fixtures cannot hold decoded.",
